{"ref":"BDB, שָׁרַץ","hw":"שָׁרַץ","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁרַץ</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. swarm, teem (</strong>NH id.<em>;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܫܪܰܨ</span> <em>crawl</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܫܶܪܨܳܐ</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁרֶץ</span>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁרְצָא</span> (rare); Ethiopic ሠረጸ: <em>germinate, sprout</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:30\" href=\"/Psalms.105.30\">ψ 105:30</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שָֽׁרְצוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:21\" href=\"/Genesis.1.21\">Gn 1:21</a>, etc.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁרֹץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.9\">Ez 47:9</a>, etc.; Imv. mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁרְצוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:7\" href=\"/Genesis.9.7\">Gn 9:7</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשֹּׁרֵץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:21\" href=\"/Genesis.7.21\">7:21</a> +, f. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשֹּׁרֶ֫צֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:46\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.46\">Lv 11:46</a>; Hex mostly P:— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>swarm, teem</em> with (acc. animal), subj. water <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:20\" href=\"/Genesis.1.20\">Gn 1:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:21\" href=\"/Genesis.1.21\">21</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:28\" href=\"/Exodus.7.28\">Ex 7:28</a> (J), land <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:30\" href=\"/Psalms.105.30\">ψ 105:30</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>swarm</em>, subj. animal <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:17\" href=\"/Genesis.8.17\">Gn 8:17</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רָבָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.9\">Ez 47:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשֹּׁרֵץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:21\" href=\"/Genesis.7.21\">Gn 7:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:29\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.29\">Lv 11:29</a> (P). <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:41\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.41\">41</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:42\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.42\">42</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:46\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.46\">46</a> (J) (all <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־הָאָרֶץ</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:43\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.43\">43</a>; subj. men <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:7\" href=\"/Genesis.9.7\">Gn 9:7</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רָבָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 1:7\" href=\"/Exodus.1.7\">Ex 1:7</a> (id., + <span dir=\"rtl\">עָצַם</span>).","next":"BDB, שֶׁ֫רֶץ","prev":"BDB, שִׁרְיָ֑ן"}